    <string name="tagline">Guess the word. Catch the imposter.</string>
    <string name="how_to_play_title">How to play</string>
    <string name="how_to_play_body">Each player secretly sees a word. Everyone shares the same word — except one imposter, who sees a different word from the same category. Take turns describing your word without saying it. When all have spoken, vote out the person you think is the imposter. If you catch the imposter, the team scores; if the imposter slips through, the imposter wins. Play as many rounds as you like!</string>
